{"title":"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A farm has 500 animals, each of which is one of three types: a goat, a cow, or a chicken. The number of goats is two times the number of cows. If 10% of the animals on the farm are chickens, how many of the animals on the farm are cows?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/8992fe09f246a54f94b893f8201f473ba8404b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\% = \\frac{10}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39b14023c98c943554d150561aacc188c4ce26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> animals are chickens, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/f/96f87e4b81959b92683ecbe8be76bf678e84b017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{100} \\times 500 = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" /> of the animals are chickens, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/77121c7c469b81598a97d44d043c2ab80b21e02b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500 - 50 = 450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" /> of the animals are <i>not</i> chickens.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of cows. Since there are twice as many goats as cows, the number of goats is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f6072f36e4577a20084d5e518bf7e2f2068ab3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63cbee8651b2252efc793735840f8116a99a7a29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c + 2c = 450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4de2972cee637dd4afcbcd0c927555a87ab632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3c = 450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cf8cd8e9c5550420c4bdb7d008702924abeb19a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{450}{3} = \\boxed{150}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC\" title=\"2018 CIMC\">2018 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></ta